        <briefdescription>
<para>Writes a value to the field (Read-Write Policy). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Performs a Read-Modify-Write cycle:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Reads the register.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Clears the bits corresponding to this field.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sets the new value for this field.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Writes the result back.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This preserves the state of all other bits (neighbors) in the register. </para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>val</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The value to write (will be masked and shifted automatically). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
